Package: emoji-picker
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3,
 python3-pyqt6,
 python3-cairo,
 python3-gi,
 python3-gi-cairo,
 gir1.2-pango-1.0,
 wl-clipboard,
 ydotool,
 fonts-noto-color-emoji
Maintainer: Kevin Fischer <web2go.webdesign@googlemail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jockel09/emoji-picker
Description: fast emoji picker for KDE Plasma on Wayland
 Inserts emojis directly into the focused window, rather than only copying
 them to the clipboard as most Linux emoji pickers do under Wayland.
 .
 Includes categories, search in English and German, favorites, recently used
 emojis, skin tone and gender selectors, optional kaomoji, multi-insert with
 Shift, and full keyboard navigation. Color emojis are rendered through
 Cairo/Pango.
 .
 Direct insertion needs access to /dev/uinput and a running ydotool service.
 Run "emoji-picker-setup" once as your own user to arrange both.
